@startuml
actor User
participant "Active Web Page (DOM)" as Page
participant "Injected Script (Canvas/Gmail/Overleaf)" as Injected
participant "Content Script (check.js / Grammarly.js)" as Content
participant "Inkwell Editor IFrame (index.html)" as Inkwell
participant "UI Component (SidePanel / Popup)" as UI
participant "Background SW (Grammarly-bg.js)" as Background
database "Chrome Storage (local/sync/managed)" as Storage
participant "Grammarly Cloud APIs (capi.grammarly.com)" as CAPI
participant "Telemetry & Metrics (gnar/femetrics)" as Telemetry

User -> Page: Interact / Type text
Page -> Content: Capture user input / text changes
Content -> Background: Send document state / text chunk (runtime.sendMessage)
Content -> Injected: Inject early injector / canvas helper (script injection)
Injected -> Page: Read canvas text / intercept events
Page -> Inkwell: Injected editor iframe wrapper for card popups
Inkwell -> Background: Connect via custom Port channel (runtime.connect)
UI -> Background: Manage auth state / open side panel assistant
Background -> Storage: Cache user settings / token / metrics
Background -> CAPI: Establish WebSocket Connection (wss://capi.grammarly.com)
Background -> CAPI: Send text revisions & receive grammar alerts (CAPI WebSocket)
Background -> Telemetry: Upload telemetry and usage metrics (gnar.grammarly.com)
Background -> UI: Propagate suggestions and UI cards
UI -> User: Render corrections / suggestion cards / SidePanel assistance
@enduml
